window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After Raina LeBlanc shows up for a meeting unprepared because she was watching naughty videos late at night instead of working, she finds herself in trouble with Dr. Eliot Knight, her stern, handsome boss. He makes it clear that she is in need of strict discipline, and soon she is lying over his knee for a painful, embarrassing bare-bottom spanking. </p> <p>Though her helpless display of arousal during the punishment fills Raina with shame, she is both excited and comforted when Eliot takes her in his arms after it is over, and when he invites her to spend the upcoming Christmas holiday with him she happily agrees. But is she prepared to offer him the complete submission he demands? </p> <p>Publisher's note: <i>Kept for Christmas</i> includes spankings and sexual scenes. If such material offends you, please don't buy this book. This book is also available as part of a collection entitled <i>A Very Naughty Christmas</i>. </p>"; 
